      "content": "that makes sense. i just feel like sometimes \"smart regulation\" is just another way for politicians to keep adding more layers that eventually become impossible for small businesses to navigate. do you think there's a legitimate argument that most of these protections are actually just overreach that does more harm than good for the economy?",
